'''Frosty''' is an [[uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Christmas box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is frosted in a bright blue block of ice with snowflakes varying in different sizes imprinted over it. The guard is white, and the handle is solid black. 

